# Never publish client data or local artifacts.
# Client base files, IRR sheets and rendered decks/workbooks: every office and
# data format is blocked, whatever it is called. Test with the synthetic files
# from tools/make-sample-base.js, which are written to test-data/ (also blocked).
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.xlsb
*.xls
*.ods
*.csv
*.tsv
*.pptx
*.ppt
*.docx
*.doc
*.pdf
*.msg
*.zip
*.7z
# rendered slides / screenshots of client decks
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
Portfolio Review_*Family*
test-data/

# Obsolete or duplicate dashboard copies: the CMS embeds a password hash and a token push path
Centricity_Portfolio_CMS.html
Portfolio_Review.html
.env

# Vendor workbooks are licensed third-party data: they stay on OneDrive/SharePoint.
For Centricity Portfolio Review Portal/

# Refresh-pipeline intermediates (before/after snapshots contain client holdings)
buildtools/out/

# Pre-change backups of the dashboard — local changelog, never published
# (19 of these total ~173 MB and would blow past GitHub's file-size limits)
*.pre_*
*.bak

# Reading copies of index.html's code blocks (tools/extract-blocks.js)
.blocks/

# Machine-local Claude Code settings
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md

# Editor / OS / tool noise
~$*
.~lock.*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
node_modules/
*.log
